  "body": "Synapse currently sends requests to `/store-invite` using the `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` content-type header: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/synapse/handlers/room_member.py#L908\r\n\r\nThe IS spec [says](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/identity_service/r0.2.1#api-standards):\r\n\r\n> all API calls use a Content-Type of `application/json`\r\n\r\nIt currently works because Sydent supports both `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` and `application/json` but this doesn't sound like something we'd want to do.",
